 users' reader.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="739397">podcast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2188398">hlaðvarp</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2066_234852_1108843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A format for reports from the electronic banking system that is used in Belgium.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234852">CODA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1108843">CODA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20664_740901_2851082"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of the primary colors of ink in the CMYK color model used in printing, whose name is derived from the dye magenta. A color from the Outlook calendar color palette.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="740901">magenta</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851082">blárauður</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20673_741964_1956418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mailbox that represents conference rooms and company equipment. Resource mailboxes can be included as resources in meeting requests, providing a simple and efficient way to utilize resources for an organization. The user account that is associated with a resource mailbox is disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="741964">resource mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956418">tilfangapósthólf</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20675_743746_1522366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To monitor an email conversation or newsgroup thread. The headers for messages in a watched conversation appear in a different color, which makes them easier to find in a message list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="743746">watch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1522366">vakta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20683_745706_1170967"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option on the Views menu in File Explorer that shows the most appropriate details for the file type in a flexible layout rather than only showing the details associated with the column headers in the view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="745706">Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1170967">Efni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20689_2356132_2359340"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Control Panel that provides the user with a single point of entry for tasks and notifications related to security and general PC software maintenance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2356132">Security and Maintenance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359340">Öryggi og viðhald</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20695_746372_1170969"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A gallery that allows users to create a quick rule to move mail to a selected folder based on the sender, recipients, or conversation of the currently selected email message without opening the full Create Rule dialog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746372">Always Move gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1170969">Safnið Færa alltaf</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20697_777440_1170970"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of computers on a home network that can share pictures, music, videos, documents, and printers. A homegroup is created by using the HomeGroup feature; it is protected with a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777440">homegroup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1170970">heimahópur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20698_782774_1170971"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A password that helps prevent unauthorized access to homegroup files and printers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782774">homegroup password</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1170971">aðgangsorð heimahóps</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20702_746417_1170972"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A digital or paper format pack that usually consists of a proof of purchase, the description of the licensing terms and pol