 of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767631">Reply to All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1171034">Svara öllum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21265_767632_1171034"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that initiates an email response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767632">Reply All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1171034">Svara öllum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21277_768421_1171035"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mode of Windows Photo Viewer which consists of a top level window displaying one photograph at a time, with navigation controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768421">Photo Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1171035">Myndaskoðari</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote