 can be added to a search to filter the results by a specific property (for example, by author). Relevant search filters appear under the search box in any open folder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056204">search filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1171116">leitarsía</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22919_1056243_1956214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of Internet Protocol subnets, usually used to connect a group of computers that are physically close to each other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056243">Active Directory site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956214">Active Directory netverk</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22926_1056255_1956212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of sign-in credentials (username and password) for an Active Directory account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056255">Active Directory credentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956212">skilríki Active Directory</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</term