ynd fyrir lagnir og mælingar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24863_1166063_3022146"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram that shows how industrial process equipment is interconnected by a system of pipelines, including instruments and valves that monitor and control the flow of materials through the pipelines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1166063">piping and instrumentation diagram</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022146">P&amp;ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24863_1166063_3022149"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram that shows how industrial process equipment is interconnected by a system of pipelines, including instruments and valves that monitor and control the flow of materials through the pipelines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1166063">piping and instrumentation diagram</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022149">Skýringarmynd fyrir lagnir og mælingar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry 