Note></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32930_2790091_2793030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data that shows how products are used including where, how often, with which other software and hardware. This data is used to identify user needs and experiences as well as potential marketing and product improvement opportunities over time. Partners and Microsoft can better understand what happens between planning, lab testing, sales data, and real world scenarios over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2790091">diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2793030">greiningargögn</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32934_1722196_1823177"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function that returns the first non-null expression from a list of arguments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1722196">COALESCE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1823177">COALESCE</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32994_2027122_2032195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An app for Mac computers that creates a folder on the user's computer, downloads the contents of their OneDrive, and keeps the folder in sync