 and users from malware and other threats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3073145">Defender</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3075194">Defender</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43468_2721513_2722627"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that helps to isolate enterprise-defined untrusted sites based on a list of trusted web sites, cloud resources and internal networks defined by an enterprise administrator. Everything not on that list is considered untrusted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2721513">Application Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2722627">Forritavörn</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43468_2795831_2722627"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that helps to isolate enterprise-defined untrusted sites based on a list of trusted web sites, cloud resources and internal networks defined by an enterprise administrator. Everything not on that list is considered untrusted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795831">Microsoft Defender Application Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></term