e edition of Windows 10 designed for small and medium businesses that includes the features of Windows 10 Pro, plus additional management policies that can be helpful to business customers. This edition is only available through subscription as part of a larger package of services, and is not available as a standalone download.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466997">Windows 10 Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470334">Windows 10 Business</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43729_2467028_2659451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The icon that shows when someone @mentions somebody, likes something that person has posted, or replies to a thread somebody has started.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467028">Activity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2659451">Virkni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43730_2467029_2659358"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subunit of a team in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467029">channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:l