etailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470196">VRR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472911">VRR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43769_2470203_2474775"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 Advanced Threat Protection reporting feature that gives users interactive, personalized visual reports of the threats to their organization, provides context for attacks, and that provides actionable steps for protection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470203">Threat explorer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2474775">Yfirlit yfir ógnir</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43799_2470927_2472182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The lightweight markup language with plain text formatting syntax designed to be converted to HTML and other formats and that is used to format readme files, write messages in online discussion forums, and create rich text using a plain text editor.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470927">Markdown</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSe