re in Windows Defender Security Center that monitors your device and provides you with information and recommendations in a Health report to address common issues with your storage capacity, device drivers, battery life, or Windows Update.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524668">Health Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2528421">Ástandsvöktun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44826_2524671_2528420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Windows Defender Security Center that helps you refresh your device by reinstalling and updating Windows — for example, if your device has performance issues or you have too many unnecessary apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524671">Fresh Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2528420">Hreint borð</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44827_2524676_2528425"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The pre-release version of Microsoft Remote Desktop app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524676">Microsoft Remote Desktop Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet