ection, where customers can set up or initiate file restores with cloud providers, to help recover from a ransomware attack (which often encrypts files).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594920">Ransomware data recovery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2596993">Endurheimt gagna vegna gagnagíslatökuforrits</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46048_2594927_2596998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Defender Security Center, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar), where customers can find and use features to help prevent or recover from ransomware attacks.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594927">Ransomware protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2596998">Vörn gegn gagnagíslatökuforritum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46049_2594936_2597008"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Defender Security Center, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar) where customers can see the history of the threats found on their devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594936">Threat history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNot