ides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2671644">Security Policy Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673839">Leiðbeinandi öryggisreglu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2671644_2766079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2671644">Security Policy Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766079">SPA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46554_2764076_2673839"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that analyzes clients' usage, provides recommendations on how to configure features in a way that reduces the attack surface without interrupting critical workflows, and that provides supporting data on feature usage and security ris