 Score in M365 admin center, which provides data, insights and recommendations related to optimization of devices, software, and other technology in your organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819429">technology experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2826137">tækniupplifun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49858_2819429_2834633"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in M365 admin center, which provides data, insights and recommendations related to optimization of devices, software, and other technology in your organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819429">technology experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834633">Tækniupplifun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49858_2831275_2826137"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A section of the Productivity Score in M365 admin center, which provides data, insights and recommendations related to optimization of devices, software, and other technology in your organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2831275">Technology experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote t