lag of Azerbaijan on November 9, 1918.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891257">National Flag Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2892076">Þjóðfánadagur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51309_2891258_2892077"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The day on which the Azerbaijan National Flag Day is celebrated if the official holiday itself falls on a weekend.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891258">National Flag Day (Observed)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2892077">Þjóðfánadagur (haldinn hátíðlegur)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5131_159863_571397"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of detecting and splitting video content into separate clips. Clips are created by Windows Movie Maker when there is a significant change from one frame to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="159863">clip creation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="571397">gerð myndskeiða</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech