 industry analysts and designed to deliver intelligent, automated, and integrated security across domains to help defenders connect seemingly disparate alerts and get ahead of attackers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013005">XDR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013978">XDR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53007_3013006_3013963"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A common user identity for authentication and authorization to all resources, regardless of location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013006">hybrid identity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013963">blandað auðkenni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53008_3013008_3013970"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagram used to visually organize information, showing relationships among pieces of the whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013008">mind map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013970">hugkort</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="