base e, which is approximately 2.71828) and common logarithms (to the base 10) are used in programming. Languages such as C and Basic include functions for calculating natural logarithms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="76437">logarithm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2998664">lógaritmi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53031_3014789_3059485"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure offering that supports Azure Virtual Desktop on Azure Stack HCI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014789">Azure Virtual Desktop on Azure Stack HCI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059485">Azure Virtual Desktop á Azure Stack HCI</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53031_3014789_3059497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure offering that supports Azure Virtual Desktop on Azure Stack HCI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014789">Azure Virtual Desktop on Azure Stack HCI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059497">Virtual Desktop on Azure Stack HCI</term><termNote type="geogr