y Microsoft products past the end of support. It includes Critical and/or Important security updates for a maximum of three years after the product's End of Extended Support date.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031385">Extended Security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031413">Ítarlegt öryggi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53212_3031386_3031414"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Business Central onboarding tour that opens a page in a special mode that suppresses other tours and shines a bright spotlight on core capabilities, such as Open in Excel or Share to Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031386">spotlight tour</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031414">kynning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53213_3031665_3032117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A form of online advertising in which paid ads are displayed among search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031665">search advertising</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032117">leitarauglýsingar</term><t