ift, store evaluations, recurring action items) based off out-of-the-box tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052180">Updates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052641">Uppfærslur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53613_3052187_3052640"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that connects business owners with payment providers in Microsoft Teams and helps them receive payments from customers while they register for a webinar and during a meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052187">Payments</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052640">Greiðslur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53614_3052229_3052634"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The free Microsoft-owned domain used by default for some automatic user creation and domain transfer scenarios when the tenant hasn't added a custom domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052229">fallback domain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052634">varalén</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote