and other relevant marketing content to its users from within Dynamics 365 F&amp;O business apps (Finance, Supply Chain, and Commerce). Subscription center will allow Core PMMs to market directly towards their current customer install-based users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097645">Subscription center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097932">áskriftarstöð</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54536_3097646_3097933"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The globalization capability in Dynamics 365 that automates tax determination and calculations to improve compliance with complex global regulations. Tax calculation is available in Dynamics 365 Finance, Supply Chain Management, Project Operations, and Commerce.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097646">tax calculation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097933">skattaútreikningur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54537_3097647_3097934"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rule that defines time conversion between local time and Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) for a particular time zone at a particular time period.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30976