nks at the top of a retailer's website, and features images of products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100694">PLA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100826">Auglýsing fyrir afurðaskráningu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54557_3099738_3112089"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that removes a bad actor from the customer’s environment, builds resilience for future attacks, and mends defences after a cybersecurity incident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099738">Microsoft Incident Response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3112089">Viðbrögð Microsoft við atvikum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54560_3099917_3100073"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The add-on for Dynamics 365 Business Central that enables partners who have enabled performance tracking in their existing customer solutions to set up and execute application performance tests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099917">Performance Toolkit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100073">Performance Toolkit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54561_3100099_3100115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that lets users capture and upload a receipt, so that they can attach it to an expense report later. Users can also quickly create an expense line by using an attached receipt, and create and manage their expense reports. Additionally, approvers can view expense reports that are assigned to them, and either approve or reject those expense reports.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100099">Dynamics 365 Expense Mobile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100115">Dynamics 365 Expense Mobile</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54564_3100233_3100297"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows organizations using Teams Phone to assign one calling plan across multiple users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100233">shared calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100297">samnýtt símtöl</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54565_3100234_3100299"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Teams meetings that allows participants to augment their video stream with visual effects, such as make up, styles and frames.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100234">video filters</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100299">myndbandssíur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54566_3100235_3100298"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides a personal meeting stage configuration that keeps sign language interpreters and other signers in a consistent, central location with the highest available video quality throughout the meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100235">sign language view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100298">táknmálssýn</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54567_3100236_3100296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to create policies for specific priority users (C-Suite) that filter out unwanted communication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100236">priority account chat control</term><termNote type="p