em (LMS) by allowing educators to create, organize, and reuse their course content over time and allowing students to find relevant learning resources in Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103943">Classwork</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104162">Vinna í skólastofunni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103944_3104163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103944">Cloud-Native Application Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104163">Vörn fyrir forrit sem eiga uppruna sinn í skýi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103944_3104164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103944">Cloud-Native Application Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104164">CNAPP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103945_3104163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103945">CNAPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104163">Vörn fyrir forrit sem eiga uppruna sinn í skýi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54662_3103945_3104164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integrated security approach that covers the entire lifecycle of cloud-native applications by combining cloud security posture management (CSPM), cloud workload protection (CWP), cloud infrastructure entitlement management (CIEM), and cloud applications security broker (CASB).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103945">CNAPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104164">CNAPP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54663_3103946_3104161"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Security kit that includes infographics, videos, and an email to help users protect identities, devices, and data, safeguard from phishing and other scams, manage passwords efficiently and keep software up to date.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103946">Be Cyber Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104161">Netsnjall</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54664_3103947_3104165"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Jargon or popular language for the use of multiple cloud computing and storage services in a single heterogeneous architecture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103947">multicloud</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104165">fjölský</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54665_3103948_3104166"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to cryptographically tie tokens to the device a user originally signed in from.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103948">token protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104166">táknvörn</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54667_3104366_3105103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container-like module that is used to organize the information or modules on a page by providing a collapsible drawer-like capability. An accordion module can be used on any page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104366">accordion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105103">felling</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54668_3104367_3105104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Dynamics 365 Commerce module that is used to display and link to loyalty program information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104367">Account loyalty</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105104">Vildarreikningur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54669_3104368_3105105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A module that provides product information needed to make a purchase decision and allows the user to add the items to cart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104368">buy box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105105">kaupgluggi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5467_375735_378614"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mechanism that helps reduce the volume of antivirus scanning that is required across an organization by stamping messages that have been scanned for viruses with metadata that indicates the version of the antivirus software that performed the scan and the result of that scan. This metadata, or "stamp," travels securely with the message as it is routed through different email servers within the organization and is used to determine whether subsequent additional virus scanning on the message can be bypassed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="375735">antivirus stamping</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="378614">veiruvarnarstimplun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54670_3104369_3105106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A code-free style change that overrides any Dynamics 365 Commerce module's Cascading Style Sheets (CSS).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104369">CSS override</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105106">CSS-hnekking</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54671_3104370_3105108"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A programmatically determined marker in your published pages that allows screen-reader users to understand where they are currently located in the webpage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104370">landmark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105108">staðsetningarmerki</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54672_3104371_3105109"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A card that entitles the card holder to participate in the loyalty programs that are assigned to the card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104371">loyalty card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105109">vildarkort</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54673_3104372_3105111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number assigned systematically to a new call center channel. Because call centers are created as operating units, users can link the call center channel to various Commerce features, such as assortments, catalogs, and specific modes of delivery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104372">operating unit number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105111">rekstrareiningarnúmer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54673_3104372_3105113"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number assigned systematically to a new call center channel. Because call centers are created as operating units, users can link the call center channel to various Commerce features, such as assortments, catalogs, and specific modes of delivery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104372">operating unit number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3105113">OUN</term><termNote type="geographicalUs