om a combination of the recognized invoice data and master data from Dynamics 365 Finance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3124946">derivation process</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125027">afleiðuferli</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5511_55836_570752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The overall layout or pattern of a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="55836">format</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="570752">snið</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55113_3125064_3144781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables the streaming of a live event, such as a corporate-wide gathering, to an internal, large-scale audience, using advanced production tools and structured attendee management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125064">town hall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3144781">samráðsfundur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55114_3125065_3125237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to perform one-click cropping of images based on AI's understanding of the key elements in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125065">auto crop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125237">sjálfvirkur skurður</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55115_3125066_3125240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft point-in-time recovery solution that enables customers to react and respond to cyber security threats.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125066">Microsoft 365 Backup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125240">Öryggisafrit Microsoft 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55116_3125067_3125242"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cold data storage solution that enables customers to keep inactive or aging data within SharePoint at a cost-effective price.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125067">Microsoft 365 Archive​</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125242">Skjalasafn Microsoft 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55117_3125068_3125243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to migrate chats and meetings between tenants so that they can access their chat history and continue to use the same threads and meetings after migrating.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125068">Cross-tenant Teams Migration​</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125243">Flutningur Teams þvert á leigjendur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55118_3125069_3136751"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's multi-tenant cloud-based directory and identity management service that combines core directory services, application access management, and identity protection into a single solution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125069">Microsoft Entra ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3136751">Auðkenni Microsoft Entra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gramm