ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6474_329880_572150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology allowing users to inject faults into an executable without requiring rebuilding the binary or modifying the source code; thus, providing a means of simulating errors and testing recovery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="329880">fault injection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="572150">villusáning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6475_307228_571907"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The heading for the last Mail Merge step, which allows the user to select how the merged publication or letters are produced.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307228">Complete the merge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="571907">Ljúka sameiningu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6477_413711_1822626"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A recording that is attached to your document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="413711">voice comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><