uage and a geographic area. Locales include information on sorting rules, date and time formatting, numeric and monetary conventions, and character classification.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="76244">locale</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="570881">landsstaðall</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7948_52504_570728"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To output data and database objects to another database, spreadsheet, or file format so another database, application, or program can use the data or database objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="52504">export</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="570728">flytja út</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7949_1509579_1169759"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portable computer that allows you to write on or interact with the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1509579">tablet PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1169759">spjaldtölva</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</t