rd) where you can connect a universal serial bus (USB) device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="126524">USB port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2918979">USB-tengi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9466_3739_570361"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To transfer a copy of a file from a local computer to a remote computer by means of a modem or network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3739">upload</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="570361">hlaða upp</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9468_297006_571862"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In computer games, an additional score or points given for efficient play.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297006">efficiency bonus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="571862">bónuspunktar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9469_44336_1421468"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type that references a method. Once a delegate is assigned a method, it behaves exactly like that method. Delegates are roughly similar to function pointers in C++; however, they are type-safe and secure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="44336">delegate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1421468">fulltrúi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="947_233127_1108792"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An agreement between a service provider and a customer that specifies the amount and type of service the provider will deliver.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233127">service agreement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1108792">þjónustusamningur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9478_138885_571254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The horizontal bar at the top of a column. You can click a column selector to select an entire column in the query design grid or the filter design grid.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138885">column selector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote>