 a particular bank or for cash held at the company. For some companies, a liquidity account records transactions in liquid investments that can be sold from day to day.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="228497">liquidity account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1109110">greiðslugetulykill</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9488_115096_1822412"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character that is not found on your keyboard and must be inserted from within the software or by pressing a combination of keys on your keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115096">special character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1822412">sértákn</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9492_494947_640114"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The timestamp of the most recent modification of a Navision entity. The modified entries are retrieved from the Change Log. If the Last Modified Date/Time is older than the last synchronization time, then entities will not be synchronized. If The Last Modified Date/Time is more recent, the synchronization will be performed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="494947">Last Modified Date/Time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="640114">Síðasta breytta dagsetning/tími</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9492_494947_640116"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The timestamp of the most recent modification of a Navision entity. The modified entries are retrieved from the Change Log. If the Last Modified Date/Time is older than the last synchronization time, then entities will not be synchronized. If The Last Modified Date/Time is more recent, the synchronization will be performed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="494947">Last Modified Date/Time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="is"><ntig><termGrp><term id="640116">LMDT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ISL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9492_494949_640114"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The timestamp of the most recent modification of a Navision entity. The modified entries are retrieved from the Change Log. If the Last Modified Date/Time is older than the last synchronization time, then entities will not be synchronized. If The Last Modified Date/Time is more recent, the synchronization will be performed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="494949">LMDT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet